  "definition": "Scope|The AccountHoldingInformationRequest message is sent by an instructing party, for example, a (new) plan manager (transferee), to the executing party, for example, a (old) plan manager (transferor), on behalf of the initiating party, for example, an investor (client), to request information about financial instruments held on behalf of the client.|Usage|The AccountHoldingInformationRequest message is used to request information about assets held on behalf of the client for which it intends to instruct a portfolio transfer at a later time.",
